  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Shrine — Innate Technique (3rd level)</em></p><p>At 3rd level, you learn how to cleave living targets in one fell swoop. As an action for up to 10 Cursed Energy, you choose a target within 5 feet. Make a melee Cursed Energy attack. On a hit, the target takes a number of d10s equal to your proficiency bonus + Cursed Energy spent in slashing damage and must make a Constitution save. <br />\n On a failure, further uses against the same creature ignores resistances as <em>Cleave</em> adjusts to the target’s toughness.  </p>",
